     2340   define variable vss-include-info23 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2341   on F8 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere do:
     2342     if b-del :sensitive then DO: apply "CHOOSE":U to b-del in frame Dialog-Frame. END.
     2343     return no-apply.
     2344   end.
     2345   define variable vss-include-info24 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2346   on F2 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere do:
